1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,460
I was so preoccupied with my little buddy's brief recovery yesterday that I was hardly able to sleep.

2
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:12,720
Fitz was all I could think about.

3
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:15,980
And yet, not so much as a twitch from downstairs.

4
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:19,080
What a traitor.

5
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:21,900
At least I know all hope isn't lost, I guess.

6
00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:29,400
Good morning, Master Luke.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,020
How are you? A bit surprised to see you up so early.

8
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:36,100
Do we need to have a talk about Fitz?

9
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:39,140
I can't think of any reason we would.

10
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:41,800
Really? Not a single one?

11
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:45,580
Fair. I can see why you wouldn't trust me.

12
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:52,660
I may be repeating myself, Luke. I don't know.

13
00:00:52,660 --> 00:00:56,540
But listen, I have no intention of opposing any of you.

14
00:00:57,320 --> 00:00:59,520
I don't know anything about Master Fitz.

15
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,240
Or any secrets he might be hiding.

16
00:01:03,020 --> 00:01:05,660
You're truly that willing to feign ignorance for us?

17
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:06,740
How come?

18
00:01:07,180 --> 00:01:09,100
I've cut all ties with our family.

19
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:11,560
So I have no loyalty to them over you.

20
00:01:11,560 --> 00:01:15,720
Moreover, I'm kind of afraid to get on the Princess's bad side.

21
00:01:16,360 --> 00:01:18,540
And I would prefer to leave it at that.

22
00:01:25,980 --> 00:01:28,620
The last thing I want is to make trouble for Fitz.

23
00:01:28,620 --> 00:01:32,480
But this isn't going to be easy for me.

24
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:33,480
My body.

25
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:15,960
Your Highness, you asked for me to meet you, so…

26
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:20,960
