38
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:09,960
No need to rush something so important.

39
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:13,960
However, after six months without any progress to speak of,

40
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:14,960
you have.

41
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:16,960
