68
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:31,960
Then I guess…

69
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:35,960
I think…

70
00:05:47,960 --> 00:05:48,960
What I want…

71
00:05:49,960 --> 00:05:50,960
Is to be with Rudy.

72
